  <text>
    <body>
      <p>The Carlton Flour Mill is listed in <ref target="civic?id=Leicester%20Street">Leicester Street</ref> in the Sands &amp; McDougall directories from 1857 to 1870. In 1857 it is listed under Ramsden and Aitken, and from 1858 under Samuel Ramsden. It is at No. 39 from 1859 to 1861 and No. 52 from 1862 to 1870.</p>
